OL,3,GNEWSAHousing estate plans thrown out   
OL,4,Aover tree concerns                     
OL,6,FPlans for 360 homes on the outskirts of
OL,7,Fa market town have been thrown out by a
OL,8,Fcouncil due to concerns over the loss  
OL,9,Fof trees and impact on the landscape.  
OL,11,FThe proposals put forward by Holkham   
OL,12,FEstates Company would have included a  
OL,13,Fmixture of houses, apartments,         
OL,14,Fbungalows and affordable housing on    
OL,15,Ffarmland at Dumpling Green off Yaxham  
OL,16,FRoad south of Dereham, Norfolk.        
OL,18,FDespite being recommended for approval 
OL,19,Fby Breckland Council officers, members 
OL,20,Fof the Planning Committee Meeting      
OL,21,Frefused the application on Tuesday.    
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
